&lt;li&gt;Experience running change, release and incident processes in a controlled environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of IT general controls, access management and audit evidence requirements, ideally in a regulated or listed company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing suppliers and technology partners&lt;/li&gt;
