&lt;p&gt;Zscaler complies with all applicable federal, state, and local pay transparency rules.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zscaler is committed to providing reasonable support (called accommodations or adjustments) in our recruiting processes for candidates who are differently abled, have long term conditions, mental health conditions or sincerely held religious beliefs, or who are neurodivergent or require pregnancy-related support.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Founding GTM Engineering Lead (GrowthBricks)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you someone who likes to build GTM systems from the ground up? Have you built sales automations, signal-based workflows, account intelligence systems, or AI-powered GTM solutions yourself?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Founding GTM Engineering Lead&lt;/strong&gt; to build GrowthBricks with us, turning real GTM problems into working systems and using what we learn to shape the product itself.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About JetBrains&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We create intelligent software development tools for developers and teams. More than 15 million users, over 300,000 companies, and 88 of the Fortune Global Top 100 rely on our products to solve real, complex problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;JetMinds is a new JetBrains-backed venture focused on AI-native GTM tools, and GrowthBricks is one of its new projects, designed to give GTM teams and AI agents a shared business brain. It brings together business context that’s usually fragmented across CRMs, calls, documents, dashboards, and other tools, giving people and AI agents the context they need to make better decisions and execute effectively across the sales and marketing stack.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own our early customer implementations and help the founding team shape the product around what actually works.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working directly with customers, you&#39;ll figure out their GTM operations, identify where agentic automations can help, and build solutions around those needs. Alongside the product and technical founders, you’ll use what you learn from these implementations to shape GrowthBricks itself.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Day to day, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with customers to understand their GTM workflows, systems, data, and bottlenecks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn ambiguous business problems into working GTM systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help build signal pipelines, account intelligence systems, enrichment and qualification workflows, outbound and CRM automation, and agentic workflows using GrowthBricks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work hands-on with tools such as CRMs, enrichment platforms, sales engagement tools, APIs, automation platforms, and AI agents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect GrowthBricks to customers’ existing GTM stack rather than rebuilding it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify patterns across customers and turn them into reusable product capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the product founder and engineering team to shape GrowthBricks, including building and shipping features yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication across roles. You can work effectively with founders, sales and marketing teams, RevOps specialists, and engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ambiguity. You can take an unclear business problem and work toward a concrete solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product instinct. You can recognize which customer problems should become part of the product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A practical mindset. You value working systems over unnecessary complexity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong, practical understanding of modern B2B GTM operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building sales automation, enrichment workflows, signal-based GTM systems, or similar infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with modern GTM tooling such as Clay, TheirStack, or FullEnrich.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience connecting multiple systems using APIs, webhooks, scripts, or custom integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience using LLMs or agents for GTM research, qualification, personalization, and automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing GTM systems across multiple teams or customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The technical ability to build and modify product features and working solutions yourself, rather than just specifying what others should build.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In your first six months, you will have taken several customer problems from discovery to working production workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will also have helped us understand where GrowthBricks creates the most value, identified patterns that repeat across customers, and turned those patterns into reusable product capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success means building systems that customers actually use, producing measurable GTM outcomes, and making the product materially better with every implementation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join JetBrains?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong base salary. We offer competitive pay that reflects your skills and experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meaningful ownership. You will help shape the product, implementation model, and direction of GrowthBricks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible work schedule. Enjoy the freedom to work from home or from the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extra time off. More days to relax and recharge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and development opportunities. Access to conferences, courses, and language classes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation support. Assistance to help make your move as smooth and stress-free as possible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health and wellness. On-site gyms or sports club stipends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal events. Company-wide celebrations and team gatherings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer. We know great ideas can come from anyone, anywhere. That’s why we do our best to create an open and inclusive workplace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like a challenge you&#39;d enjoy, we’d love to hear from you. Send us your CV or LinkedIn profile and, more importantly, show us something you’ve built: a GTM system, automation, agent, workflow, or customer implementation you’re particularly proud of.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-IM1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We know great ideas can come from anyone, anywhere. That’s why we do our best to create an open and inclusive workplace – one that welcomes everyone regardless of their background, identity, religion, age, accessibility needs, or orientation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We process the data provided in your job application in accordance with the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.jetbrains.com/legal/docs/privacy/privacy-recruitment/&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT NEXGEN CLOUD&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NexGen Cloud is a fast-growing GPU cloud and AI infrastructure business. We&#39;re the company behind Hyperstack — a self-serve, on-demand cloud platform built for high-performance AI, HPC, and compute-heavy workloads. Powered by 100% renewable energy and NVIDIA architecture, Hyperstack gives teams from AI startups to enterprise the compute they need, without the cost or complexity of legacy cloud.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We move fast, solve hard problems, and build things that matter. If you want ownership, real impact, and a front-row seat to one of the most consequential infrastructure shifts of the decade — this is the place.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE: DATA CENTRE DEPLOYMENT LEAD&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re building GPU clusters across multiple international regions, and none of that capacity reaches customers until it&#39;s racked, cabled, commissioned and handed over. Our Senior Deployment Lead owns the pipeline but can&#39;t be on every site at once, so we need a senior onsite authority who can lead each build and hold every region to the same standard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a role for someone who&#39;s happiest on the data centre floor making the call, not waiting for one. You&#39;ll lead a team of 3–5 Deployment Engineers through each build, catch problems at planning before hardware lands, and hand over sites that Operations can run from day two. Expect around 50% international travel, remote-first in between.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL BE DOING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rather than a checklist, here&#39;s what success in this role actually looks like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own each site as the onsite decision-maker, leading Deployment Engineers day to day, directing contractors safely, and escalating only what genuinely sits beyond onsite authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with the Senior Deployment Lead, Network Engineering, Procurement &amp;amp; Supply Chain, and Data Centre Operations/NOC to take every build from validated design to clean handover.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validate design plans and BOMs before hardware arrives, checking space, power, cooling, weight and interoperability (optics, AOC, DAC) so issues are fixed at planning, not on site.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce and validate structured and fibre cabling designs, including length estimates, oversee cable pathing, and run cabling QC so every install matches the design before sign-off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee racking and installation of GPU servers and network hardware, support fabric installation and cutover, and make sure commissioning meets the agreed acceptance criteria.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and enforce the deployment standards every region builds to — rack, cabling, labelling and documentation — and hand over every site with complete as-built records.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run post-deployment reviews, turn the findings into better workflows, and develop your engineers so the team takes on more of each build over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT YOU&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We care more about how you think and work than a perfect CV. You&#39;ll likely bring a combination of the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Essential:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading a technical deployment team on site — allocating work and acting as the onsite authority, not just the most experienced engineer on the crew.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced structured and fibre cabling experience, including producing designs, estimating lengths and running QC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating and reviewing BOMs against space, power, cooling, weight and interoperability, including optics, AOC and DAC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant data centre deployment experience, with strong network and server hardware knowledge, and a track record of writing or enforcing standards and documentation others followed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel internationally around 50% of the time (sometimes at short notice, for days or weeks at a time), and fluent English with clear written reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Nice to Have:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GPU or HPC cluster build experience, ideally including InfiniBand and fat-tree or rail-optimised fabric designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading a multi-person deployment team across more than one country.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scripting experience, for example Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and annual discretionary bonus scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee wellbeing benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days holiday, plus public holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced Pension Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote-first working, with international travel to our deployment sites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real ownership and autonomy — the trust to take initiative and experiment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Visible, meaningful impact as we scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear career progression in a high-growth company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, international culture built on trust, transparency, and ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The chance to help shape NexGen Cloud&#39;s team, culture, and future&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY APPLY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from all backgrounds. If you enjoy solving complex infrastructure problems and want to build something meaningful at scale, we&#39;d like to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MORE INFORMATION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Visit our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nexgencloud.com/careers&quot;&gt;careers page&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about us or follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/nexgen-cloud&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/CloudNexgen&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about our journey and keep up with our latest news and releases.&lt;/p&gt;
